# Gate 0 and Gate 1 Editor build scripts are source code, not build output.
!unity/Assets/Mallang/Gate0/Editor/Build/
!unity/Assets/Mallang/Gate0/Editor/Build/**
!unity/Assets/Mallang/Gate1/Editor/Build/
